Friday AM a week ago, @potus answered my call to tell him what was playing out in Kerr County and he said “whatever we need”. 

@Sec_Noem responded in 15 minutes. 

I’ve never seen such rapid action and appreciate their presence and support. And support from the TxDel here today https://t.co/MA955Nalqe

